WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.233 --> 00:00:02.135
George: From calorie
count to portion sizes,

00:00:02.135 --> 00:00:03.970
we wanted to find out all the differences

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:06.506
between Kit Kats in Japan and the US.

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:08.742
This is "Food Wars."

00:00:10.377 --> 00:00:12.979
In Japan, our Kit Kats come in four sizes,

00:00:12.979 --> 00:00:14.547
big little pouch bite,

00:00:14.547 --> 00:00:15.715
minis,

00:00:15.715 --> 00:00:16.750
and bar,

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:18.918
and classy one, Sublime.

00:00:18.918 --> 00:00:21.588
So, one thing to note
here regarding mini sizes,

00:00:21.588 --> 00:00:24.391
the regular Kit Kat is 11.6 grams,

00:00:24.391 --> 00:00:27.427
but the flavored minis, such as matcha,

00:00:27.427 --> 00:00:30.697
are said to be slightly
smaller, 11.3 grams.

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:32.599
So I'm going to weigh them now to confirm.

00:00:32.599 --> 00:00:36.136
So, let's weigh a
regular-flavor Kit Kat first.

00:00:36.136 --> 00:00:38.038
It weighs 11 grams.

00:00:38.038 --> 00:00:39.906
But it doesn't show the decimal points,

00:00:39.906 --> 00:00:41.674
it says just 11 grams.

00:00:41.674 --> 00:00:44.711
Let's weigh matcha flavor.

00:00:44.711 --> 00:00:45.545
12.

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:47.847
It's actually heavier than regular flavor.

00:00:47.847 --> 00:00:48.748
Interesting.

00:00:48.748 --> 00:00:51.418
Japanese Kit Kats have become
popular all around the world,

00:00:51.418 --> 00:00:53.720
and the US, of course, is no exception.

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:54.954
I just want to mention at the top here,

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:56.122
we're going to be talking about Kit Kats

00:00:56.122 --> 00:00:57.624
that are native to our countries.

00:00:57.624 --> 00:00:58.925
I know you can get them online.

00:00:58.925 --> 00:01:01.127
I think Walmart.com has some of them.

00:01:01.127 --> 00:01:03.430
Fantastic. They're imported.
We know. Thank you.

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:06.433
In the US, our Kit Kats
come in nine sizes.

00:01:06.433 --> 00:01:07.934
Starting from the smallest,

00:01:07.934 --> 00:01:10.870
we have a Kit Kat minis unwrapped,

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:12.272
then the thins,

00:01:12.272 --> 00:01:13.273
miniatures,

00:01:13.273 --> 00:01:14.174
snack size,

00:01:14.174 --> 00:01:15.575
standard four finger,

00:01:15.575 --> 00:01:16.876
the Big Kat.

00:01:16.876 --> 00:01:20.213
From there, we move up
to king size, which is,

00:01:20.213 --> 00:01:21.648
a piece accidentally broke off

00:01:21.648 --> 00:01:23.383
and then I accidentally ate it.

00:01:23.383 --> 00:01:25.018
The Big Kat king size.

00:01:25.018 --> 00:01:26.986
So it looks like it's just two Big Kats.

00:01:26.986 --> 00:01:29.689
And the biggest size, the XL.

00:01:32.659 --> 00:01:35.462
A bag of Kit Kat bites
should have 11 bites.

00:01:35.462 --> 00:01:37.397
Let's count in Japanese.

00:01:37.397 --> 00:01:40.033
Ichi, ni, san, shi, go,

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:42.502
roku, shichi, hachi, ku, juu,

00:01:42.502 --> 00:01:43.937
juuichi.

00:01:43.937 --> 00:01:45.071
11 bites.

00:01:45.071 --> 00:01:46.706
And according to the bag,

00:01:46.706 --> 00:01:49.042
the combined weight should be 50 grams.

00:01:49.042 --> 00:01:51.177
So let's weigh all 11 bites.

00:01:51.177 --> 00:01:52.078
Ooh!

00:01:52.078 --> 00:01:54.747
It weighs 52 grams.

00:01:54.747 --> 00:01:56.049
Good deal.

00:01:56.049 --> 00:01:58.651
All of our US sizes come
in a variety of units,

00:01:58.651 --> 00:02:00.520
depending on your Kit Kat needs.

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:01.654
So many varieties.

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:02.956
Here's a few worth mentioning.

00:02:02.956 --> 00:02:05.892
The minis. The biggest
bag of minis unwrapped

00:02:05.892 --> 00:02:08.361
you can get is 419 grams.

00:02:08.361 --> 00:02:10.163
As the title implies,

00:02:10.163 --> 00:02:12.232
these things are unwrapped little bites.

00:02:12.232 --> 00:02:14.067
It's sold like it's for
sharing, but get real.

00:02:14.067 --> 00:02:16.469
Whoever sticks their hand in
here first, it's their bag.

00:02:16.469 --> 00:02:18.138
For the miniatures, according to Amazon,

00:02:18.138 --> 00:02:20.306
you can get up to 4-pound bags,

00:02:20.306 --> 00:02:25.278
aka 1,814.37 grams.

00:02:25.278 --> 00:02:27.680
And what it looks like, they just sent me

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:31.918
a bag that's loosely 4
pounds of Kit Kat minis.

00:02:31.918 --> 00:02:34.287
All the bars have their various packs.

00:02:34.287 --> 00:02:35.622
None of them seem unusual.

00:02:35.622 --> 00:02:37.624
I will, however, mention that

00:02:37.624 --> 00:02:40.894
the biggest single purchase
of a Kit Kat item you can get

00:02:40.894 --> 00:02:43.129
is the king-size 24-pack.

00:02:43.129 --> 00:02:45.632
The total here is 2,040 grams,

00:02:45.632 --> 00:02:49.969
about 4.5 pounds of Kit Kat.

00:02:51.437 --> 00:02:54.407
Here's all the Kit Kats
exclusive to the US.

00:02:54.407 --> 00:02:57.277
And here is all the Kit
Kats native to Japan.

00:02:57.277 --> 00:02:59.646
Kit Kat in Japan is made by Nestlé

00:02:59.646 --> 00:03:02.382
and is one of the best-selling
candies in the country.

00:03:02.382 --> 00:03:04.184
One of the reasons for its popularity

00:03:04.184 --> 00:03:07.053
is that Kit Kat has a
good-luck charm in Japan

00:03:07.053 --> 00:03:10.857
because the name Kit Kat
in Japanese is Kitto Katto.

00:03:10.857 --> 00:03:13.693
And Kitto Katto sounds like "kitto katsu,"

00:03:13.693 --> 00:03:16.162
which means "you will surely win."

00:03:16.162 --> 00:03:19.332
So the Kit Kat brand became
associated with good luck.

00:03:19.332 --> 00:03:21.601
And these Kit Kats are
often given to students

00:03:21.601 --> 00:03:23.102
before their exams.

00:03:23.102 --> 00:03:24.470
For the past 20 years,

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:28.007
Kit Kat has introduced more
than 350 unique flavors.

00:03:28.007 --> 00:03:28.841
Wow!

00:03:28.841 --> 00:03:31.411
Some of them are
discontinued, unfortunately,

00:03:31.411 --> 00:03:33.279
and some of them are regional,

00:03:33.279 --> 00:03:36.349
so we couldn't get them by
the filming of this episode.

00:03:36.349 --> 00:03:37.517
