nugget before it's fried.

01:52:05.685 --> 01:52:07.487
Octopus and wasabi.

01:52:07.487 --> 01:52:09.522
This is just raw octopus.

01:52:09.522 --> 01:52:13.326
Kinpira gobo. It's sautéed burdock.

01:52:13.326 --> 01:52:16.763
Hijikini, stewed hijiki seaweed.

01:52:16.763 --> 01:52:18.498
And potato salad.

01:52:18.498 --> 01:52:21.668
So, when I go home, my mom always cooks

01:52:21.668 --> 01:52:23.503
this one, this one, this one.

01:52:23.503 --> 01:52:24.938
I love you, Mom.

01:52:24.938 --> 01:52:26.740
I miss Mom's cooking.

01:52:26.740 --> 01:52:30.376
And next we have Premium Gold main dishes.

01:52:30.376 --> 01:52:32.679
Shrimp with chili sauce.

01:52:32.679 --> 01:52:34.414
Beef stew.

01:52:34.414 --> 01:52:36.282
Hamburg steak.

01:52:36.282 --> 01:52:38.218
Sandwiches, 7-Eleven.

01:52:38.218 --> 01:52:39.185
Egg salad.

01:52:39.185 --> 01:52:40.453
Peanut butter and jelly.

01:52:40.453 --> 01:52:43.323
Turkey and cheddar
cheese on a kaiser roll.

01:52:43.323 --> 01:52:46.292
So, we have the Italian-style sub,

01:52:46.292 --> 01:52:49.929
but then we also got The Italian Job.

01:52:49.929 --> 01:52:53.299
Turkey and ham with, is that
cheese in the picture there?

01:52:53.299 --> 01:52:56.603
We got the smoked turkey and
Monterey Jack cheese sandwich,

01:52:56.603 --> 01:52:58.304
and they separated the lettuce,

01:52:58.304 --> 01:52:59.739
so you add it right before
you're ready to eat,

01:52:59.739 --> 01:53:01.074
so it's still nice and crisp.

01:53:01.074 --> 01:53:03.510
Salads, chicken Caesar salad.

01:53:03.510 --> 01:53:05.845
We also have a pepperoni pasta salad.

01:53:05.845 --> 01:53:08.148
So, here are my favorite sandwiches.

01:53:08.148 --> 01:53:11.684
It's got tuna right here
and cheese and lettuce.

01:53:11.684 --> 01:53:16.256
And the rest of these are ham and egg.

01:53:16.256 --> 01:53:20.093
I thought this is normal,
but you don't have this one,

01:53:20.093 --> 01:53:22.095
fruit sandwich.

01:53:22.095 --> 01:53:23.930
So it's got a whole bunch of fruits.

01:53:23.930 --> 01:53:28.501
It's got peach, pineapples,
and oranges on whipped cream.

01:53:28.501 --> 01:53:29.769
So it's like cake.

01:53:29.769 --> 01:53:32.605
So, here is 7-Premium drip coffee.

01:53:32.605 --> 01:53:36.042
So I'm going to make
myself a cup of coffee.

01:53:36.042 --> 01:53:38.244
Heyo!

01:53:38.244 --> 01:53:40.847
And he just sits on here.

01:53:40.847 --> 01:53:43.550
Ah! Ah ah ah!

01:53:43.550 --> 01:53:44.384
Ah!

01:53:45.318 --> 01:53:46.753
Mm.

01:53:46.753 --> 01:53:48.488
All right.

01:53:48.488 --> 01:53:49.489
Itadakimasu.

01:53:53.493 --> 01:53:55.328
It tastes like shit.

01:53:55.328 --> 01:53:57.163
So, for breakfast sandwiches at 7-Eleven,

01:53:57.163 --> 01:54:00.900
